# APM runtime artifacts — Option B policy
# Track planning documents and Stage summaries (.apm/plan.md, spec.md, tracker.md, memory/index.md, metadata.json).
# Gitignore runtime traffic and Worker Task Logs to keep main free of coordination churn.
.apm/bus/
.apm/memory/stage-*/
.apm/memory/handoffs/
.apm/worktrees/

# Test-generated pending-contract reports (auto-regenerated each test run,
# reflects current working-tree JSON validity — not a stable artifact).
# Pinned diagnostic JSONs (e.g. dedup-equivalence-canary.json) are still tracked.
.apm/diagnostics/*-validation-report.json

# Vault junction — `vault/` is a Windows directory junction to
# `C:\Users\steph\Documents\TDA-Research\` for direct content access from
# the repo (Edit/Read against vault/<path> rather than vault_get through
# the vault-engine MCP). Machine-local setup; not for commit.
# Anchored to repo root so it does NOT also ignore scripts/vault/ (tracked).
/vault/

# Stage-1 battery gitignored intermediates (T0.12 two-path rule)
# - launches/ : PID markers written before any heavy work (launch ground truth)
# - cache/    : permutation-diagram .npz cache shared headline → sensitivity
# - .partial/ : sub-phase partial JSON writes for halt resilience
results/trajectory_tda_integration/stage1/launches/
results/trajectory_tda_integration/stage1/cache/
results/**/.partial/
# - per-task checkpoint/resume dirs under stage1/ (regenerable intermediates;
#   deliverable JSONs live under their own results/ paths and are committed)
results/trajectory_tda_integration/stage1/bhps_nonoverlap_reanalysis/

# - markov2 alpha-sweep per-cell checkpoints + status files (T1.8 intermediates;
#   the committed summary JSON embeds every per-cell result inline)
results/trajectory_tda_integration/post_audit/markov2_alpha_sweep_cell_*.json
results/trajectory_tda_integration/post_audit/markov2_alpha_sweep_*.status.json

# repomix dump (regenerable; 108MB blob was rejected by GitHub LFS limit
# in commit 52af787 and removed from history via filter-repo 2026-05-22)
repomix-output.xml
repomix-output.*

# Local isolated implementation worktrees.
.worktrees/

# Repowise local index/cache. Keep the shareable MCP config tracked.
.repowise/*
!.repowise/
!.repowise/mcp.json
# ARS disposable local projections and runtime caches.
/.research-system/projections/
/.research-system/indexes/
/.research-system/runtime/
